/target
/artifacts
/coverage

# Cargo.lock IS committed here on purpose (SEC-3899): pinning the fuzz crate's
# dependency graph keeps nightly builds reproducible and blocks a malicious
# newly-published version from being pulled unreviewed. The build enforces it
# with `cargo fetch --locked` in fuzz.yml. Update via a PR-reviewed bump.

# The fuzzer writes hash-named corpus entries (no extension) into corpus/<target>/.
# Commit only the curated seed fixtures — ignore everything else under corpus/.
corpus/**
!corpus/**/
!corpus/**/*.jsonl
!corpus/**/*.bin
